[I] GLib bindings for the Telepathy D-Bus protocol

[T] Telepathy is a D-Bus framework for unifying real time communication,
[T] including instant messaging, voice and video calls. telepathy-glib is a
[T] C library using GLib for Telepathy clients, connection managers and
[T] other components, also usable from Python and JavaScript via GObject
[T] Introspection.

[U] https://telepathy.freedesktop.org/

[A] Telepathy
[M] andrei32

[C] base/library
[F] CROSS

[L] LGPL
[V] 0.99.11

[D] 59c6f161514cbb6f2f99158971713346a16719093118482d228f1da7 telepathy-glib-0.99.11.tar.gz http://telepathy.freedesktop.org/releases/telepathy-glib/

. $base/package/*/*/gnome-conf.in

#pkginstalled gtk-doc docbook-xml docbook-xsl && var_append confopt ' ' --enable-gtk-doc
pkginstalled vala && var_append confopt ' ' --enable-vala-bindings
